{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418920?t=1771712732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418920?t=1771712732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/f27f1884e246affbac1a400a21fa6feb429efb4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771712732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/f27f1884e246affbac1a400a21fa6feb429efb4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771712732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Frequent Jumpscares"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/extras/6c7a31b196e260182ed15c0f19365487.avif?t=1771712732\" width=490 height=88 /></span>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>New twist in Liminal Spaces</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal and unsettling environments that blur the line between reality and nightmare, inspired by liminal aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Atmospheric Horror</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the unease of the 1990s-inspired setting with haunting visuals and creppy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>High Replay Value</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural elements and unpredictable monster behavior make every playthrough unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Twisted entity AI</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creppy and unpredictable movements based on random waypoints/sound detection AI.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Filios Christou"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/291f16f391b1f556f454044b810adc7f5e633ca2/header.jpg?t=1771712732","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Filios Christou. All rights reserved.</strong>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Urbanism","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64-bit (latest Service Pack)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>